[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Fub
GenericName=Knowledge manager
GenericName[it]=Gestore della conoscenza
Comment=Notes, documents, spreadsheets, PDFs and drawings in your own folders
Comment[it]=Note, documenti, fogli di calcolo, PDF e disegni nelle tue cartelle
Exec=fub %u
